{"version":1,"content":"<p>在人工智能（AI）熱潮推動下，過去一年多裏，NAND閃存現貨價格出現連續了上漲，已經累積了較大的漲幅。不過隨着近期市場形勢的變化，相比起DRAM，NAND閃存似乎更早出現變化，行情開始逆轉。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586800.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:33:58.264386+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:24:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.176094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.176094+00:00","content_hash":"0b46a59168e30037c32e03dff8c89130d6a5001e9773cf083c2829c35e5c5963","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}